Package: card4r
Version: 0.4.0
Date: 2026-08-12
Title: Hydroclimatic Variables from the CARD Collection, in R
Description: A thin R front to the Python package 'card', which computes
    hydroclimatic variables (low flows, floods, seasonality, climate
    change) defined by YAML parameterization files and executed by the
    'stase' engine. Data goes in as a data frame, data frames and their
    metadata come out. The corpus and the engine are never reimplemented
    here: they are called.
